Package: denfluxR
Title: R Interface for 'DenFlux': A Process-Based Computational Framework for TDP Baseline Correction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mianzhi", "Wang", , "mianzhi.wang@helsinki.fi", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R wrapper for the Python package 'denflux'. It provides 
    a process-based computational framework to dynamically construct 
    the corrected zero-flow baseline for Granier thermal dissipation probes.
